From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 20:10:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SableOS: Text size choice in Settings > Display

Settings > Display > Text size, under Accent: Small, Medium, Large or Larger
(font scale 0.9, 1.0, 1.15, 1.3), written to Settings.System.FONT_SCALE.
Larger is the biggest size Sable lays out and tests on the Q25's 411 dp
square screen. Android's Display size and text page, with its Font size
slider, stays next to it; a scale set there shows as custom. SetupWizard's
Theme step offers the same four. Pure values in sable/SableTextSize.
---
